        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock Premiere Bronze Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis deadbolt is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-molten-bronze-collection\"><b>Weslock Molten Bronze Collection</b></a> which features door hardware with a rustic weathered appearance. It has a high security 1\" throw hardened deadbolt with a heavy duty strike plate and screws. It is available as a Single Cylinder (key operated from the outside, thumb turn operated from the inside) or a Double Cylinder (key operated from both the outside and inside) in your choice of oil rubbed bronze or matte black.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Premiere Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy duty security strike with 3\" long screws.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Premiere Bronze Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Single Cylinder Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Double Cylinder Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Single Cylinder and Double Cylinder Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits doors prepared with 2-1/8\" or 1-5/8\" cross bore hole and 1\" edge hole</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from1-3/8\" to 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable latches for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Molten Bronze Premiere Deadbolt",
                "description": "Premiere Bronze Deadbolt - This deadbolt is from the Weslock Molten Bronze Collection which features door hardware with a rustic weathered appearance. It has a high security 1 inch throw hardened deadbolt with a heavy duty strike plate and screws. It is available as a Single Cylinder (key operated from the outside, thumb turn operated from the inside) or a Double Cylinder (key operated from both the outside and inside) in your choice of oil rubbed bronze or matte black.",
